{
    "comment": "배송정책 복사 확인 창. 무엇이 복사되는지 **나라별로 펼쳐 보여 준다** — 나라·배송 방법·부과 방식·\n  기본 배송비, 그리고 도서산간 추가배송비나 중지 상태 같은 표식까지.\n  **여기서 복사하지 않는다.** 확인을 누르면 창을 닫고 등록 화면으로 넘어가면서 원본 id 를 주소에\n  실어 준다(`copy_id`). 실제 복제는 그 화면이 그 id 로 값을 불러와 채우는 것으로 이루어지고,\n  저장을 눌러야 새 정책이 생긴다.\n  보여 주는 값은 모두 목록이 담아 준 `_global.targetPolicy` 에서 온다 — 이 창은 조회하지 않는다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Shipping Policy Copy Confirmation Modal"
    },
    "id": "copy_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.title",
        "size": "medium",
        "footer": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "closeModal"
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
                },
                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.common.cancel"
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "comment": "복사 진행 — 창을 닫고 등록 화면으로 원본 id 를 실어 보낸다. 이 창은 복제를 만들지 않으므로 그 화면에서 저장을 누르지 않으면 아무것도 남지 않는다.",
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "sequence",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "handler": "closeModal"
                            },
                            {
                                "handler": "navigate",
                                "params": {
                                    "path": "/admin/ecommerce/shipping-policies/create",
                                    "mergeQuery": true,
                                    "query": {
                                        "copy_id": "{{_global.targetPolicy?.id}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-blue-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-blue-700"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Icon",
                        "props": {
                            "name": "copy",
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-base"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.confirm"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.message"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700/50 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce:space-y-3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle ecommerce:w-24 ecommerce:flex-shrink-0 ecommerce:pt-0.5"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.policy_name"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_global.targetPolicy?.name_localized ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle ecommerce:w-24 ecommerce:flex-shrink-0 ecommerce:pt-0.5"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.country_count"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_global.targetPolicy?.countries_display ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{(_global.targetPolicy?.country_settings ?? []).length > 0}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:border-t ecommerce:border-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:pt-3 ecommerce:mt-2 ecommerce:space-y-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "iteration": {
                                                "source": "{{_global.targetPolicy?.country_settings ?? []}}",
                                                "item_var": "cs",
                                                "index_var": "csIdx"
                                            },
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:text-sm"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-flag ecommerce-flag-{{cs.country_code?.toLowerCase()}} ecommerce:rounded-sm ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:w-8"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{cs.country_code}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-tone-info-soft ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:bg-blue-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-900/30 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{cs.shipping_method_label ?? ''}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "|"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:bg-purple-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-purple-900/30 ecommerce:text-purple-700 ecommerce:dark:text-purple-300 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{cs.charge_policy_label ?? ''}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{cs.charge_policy === 'fixed' || cs.charge_policy === 'conditional_free' || cs.charge_policy?.startsWith('per_')}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-secondary"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{(cs.base_fee ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} {{cs.currency_code ?? ''}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{cs.extra_fee_enabled && cs.country_code === 'KR'}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-tone-warning-soft ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:bg-yellow-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900/30 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.table.extra_fee_badge"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{!cs.is_active}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:text-red-700 ecommerce:dark:text-red-300 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.table.inactive"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.shipping_policy.modal.copy.note"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
